    "created_at": "2019-05-23T20:42:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-23T20:42:41Z",
    "body": "As of right now, the `name` option for dedicated workers is not guaranteed to be unique in any way. See https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#concept-workerglobalscope-name:\r\n\r\n> The [name](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#concept-workerglobalscope-name) can have different semantics for each subclass of [`WorkerGlobalScope`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#workerglobalscope). For [`DedicatedWorkerGlobalScope`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#dedicatedworkerglobalscope) instances, it is simply a developer-supplied name, useful mostly for debugging purposes.",
