    "created_at": "2019-05-24T00:50:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-24T00:50:00Z",
    "body": "The proposal is really less about how it is implemented, and more about being able to do direct port transfers. Though it seems that for shared workers `name` is already used for managing a reference to a worker, and with dedicated workers `name` is effectively unused. Extending the spec to use `name` on dedicated in the same way as shared uses it would support this, and make both forms more consistent.  ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
