    "updated_at": "2019-05-24T08:13:54Z",
    "body": "Welcome, https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features and https://whatwg.org/working-mode might help. What would be very good to know here is to what extent libraries have been created to abstract away the problem you're problem you're describing and what kind of patterns they ended up adopting.\r\n\r\nI'd be much more comfortable standardizing something that has seen adoption in JavaScript libraries and is successful than trying to invent something new here.",
